  ],
  "duration_s": 554.562993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？他是全中国的父母都想移民去的一个地方。这里每十个高中生就有九个能够习提本科，这里就是真正的南哥。南通中国近代第一城，你知道吗？南通市中心最贵的一百平方留给了一个人，没有，他就没有今天的学通。他去世的时候负债累累，但他一生留下了三百七十所学校，他亲手打造了这个荒僻小城，百年之后竟然逆袭成GDP过万亿的工业强市。他就是张俭先生，南通之父。八月二十四日是张俭先生逝世一百周年。最近，央视热播的江海潮生讲述的正是他的故事。张俭一生参与创建了南京大学、上海交通大学、同济大学、东南大学、复南大学等等几百座大学。比如复旦大学建立时，百分之六十的师资都来自南通。他创办了中国第一所民办师范学校、通州师范与京师大学堂南洋公学、齐名，像上海、南今、武汉等城市，输送了六千多名教师。中国近代第一所纺织水利、工艺美术警察、新型戏剧艺术、女红、工人子弟玛雅等等。你能想象到大部分行业的第一所学校都诞生在南通，而中国人的一生也基本上摆不脱南通。你上学做的试卷，南通出的，你睡觉盖了被子，南通产的，你结婚买的房子还是南通人建的？南通的高考一本率已经连续十年位居全国第一。张俭先生说，父教育，而母实业实业向母亲负责创造财富，养育社会，而教育，像父亲负责培养人才，塑造未来。一八五三年张俭出生在江苏海门，一个农户家，五岁就能被签字。文，十二岁出口成年，可在那个年代，你能不能参加科举考试，光靠你聪明还不行，竟然还要看祖上够不够资格。张戬只能借用别人的身份去应试，但没有想到，考中秀才之后，对方竟然借机敲诈张家，因此倾家荡产，欠下白银千两，但命运却没有给张姐一雪前耻的机会。二十六年间，他二十多次进出考场，却最终没有考中进士。张戬心灰意冷，几度想要放弃，终于在四十二岁一举夺魁。考中状元、朱军状元啊状元，这是天下文人的至高荣誉，也是多少人终其一生无可忘见的梦想。但是张姐考中的那一年，偏偏是甲午年，北洋舰队全军覆没，而朝廷却笙歌燕舞，庆祝慈禧六十大寿。当王公贵族都沉醉在天朝上国的幻想中时，张戬这个刚入仕途的小翰林却站出来坚决主战，甚至还上书弹劾大权在握的李鸿章。张姐可不是那种普通的无用书生。他曾经做过淮军名将吴长庆的幕僚，协助平定了朝鲜叛乱。他是水里进火里出战场上闯荡出来的硬汉子。张戬中状元的第二年，马关条约签订割地赔管，丧权辱国。张戬在日记里字字泣血，朝廷能忍，无四万万同胞不能忍。他做了一个违背祖宗的决定。他当着文武百官的面扔掉顶戴，花梨弃官从商，士农工商，当时商的地位最低，一个状元去经商。这在当时就是自甘堕落，但张姐说，愿成一分一毫有用之事，不愿居八命，九命可耻之官。为了筹集半场资金，他放下状元身段、卖字、卖画、四处借债、求人，甚至抵押了全部家产，典当了妻子的手饰，整整五年时间，沙场才艰难开工。为了栽种棉花彰碱，组织筑堤挡潮、开渠排水、洗盐、改土，把四千多万亩的盐碱地改造成棉田粮仓，让苏北涌现出了上百家盐垦公司。今天的海门港一带仍然保留着见证这段历史的张公堤。他疏浚河道，修建船闸，让海门青龙港成为长江北岸最繁忙的港口之一。在张姐的努力下，大声沙场，没几年就赚了四百万两白银，换做别人早就富甲一方了。可是张姐一分钱都没有装进自己的口袋，一件长衫能穿三四十年，袜子，棉袄破了就打补丁，直到不能再破才换新的。他对自己吝啬极致，却慷慨的设立育婴堂两年，收养一千五百多个孩子，开办七流所，收容乞丐，教他们谋生技能，也让南通成为当时全中国唯一街上没有乞丐的城市。他建立计两所，帮助风尘女子回归正常生活，自费组建测绘队、兴修水利，建堤坝，疏通河道三十多条，修建桥梁四百多座，还建了残疾院医院，让老有所依，幼有所长，残疾者皆有所养，六十大寿时，亲友要为他大摆寿宴，他就把寿宴的钱和贺礼全部拿去建了养老院。他说，一己之响，何如，众人之安，一日之废，何如百年之惠。张戬先生在南通创办了大生纱场，为全国各地输送了纺织机械三点二万多套，推动了十几万家纺织企业遍地开花，养活了全中国上千万人就业。战乱年代，南通糖闸工业区奔赴祖国十八个省市，为全国输送纺织业人才，二十一点七万人，掏空了南通一半的家底。但即便如此，南通依然是世界家纺之都，海门的叠石桥市场是全球最大的家纺市场，承包了全国人的睡眠。前世世界每十件家纺有六件，都来自南通朱君。一个人究竟要留下些什么，才能够在离开一百年以后仍被人如此怀念。张俭先生在通海大地上布下了整座近代城市的格局，他创办了中国第一座博物院。南通博物院，比故宫博物院还早二十年。第一所气象台，江苏第一条公路港闸公路。而当时江苏省百分之七十的公路都在南通修建了苏北第一条铁路、青山铁路，还成立了全国第一支交警、第一所交警学校，还建了南通第一个公共体育场，让南通涌现了三十多位世界冠军。他建公共图书馆、印书局、办报纸，让南通人用上了电灯电话。张俭先生还以南通为核心服饰全国创办的七十家企业，开创了无数个第一江浙渔业公司，开创了我国拖网渔轮业的先河。怡生酿造厂获得国酒类第一块世博会金牌，比茅台早了九年。南通秀之局将分公司开到了纽约第五大道大达轮船公司，修建了上海最著名的客运码头大达码头。江西瓷业公司建设了中国第一家近代瓷器工厂，而张瑾还是申报了大股东。甚至你现在能去故宫参观，也得感谢他，就是在他的大礼倡议之下，才成立了古物陈列所，让故宫走出了开放的第一步。他还牵头制定了中国第一部公司法商法总则森林法狩猎法。张姐做事从不问难不难，只问该不该。他说，办一线事要有一省之眼光，办一省事，要有一国之眼光，办一国事，要有世界之眼光，因为内忧外患，张戬的产业最终没能撑下去。一九二六年八月二十四日，七十三岁的张俭先生抱汗而亡，十几万人在街边为他送行。临死前，他担心的是，这儿的电厂没能建成那儿的民兵制度没能普及，从头到尾没有一件私事。他的墓碑上简简单单的一句，南通张先生状元是皇帝给的先生，是百姓教的先生。这两个字很轻，却装得下一座城。胡适评价，张姐，一个伟大的失败的英雄。可是朱军啊、朱军如果一家企业最终债台高筑，但他留下了工厂、学校、养老院、博物馆，让无数家庭有了生计，让无数孩子改变了命。密这个人究竟算成功还是失败？如果你来到南通海门，不妨去张公祠，这是家乡百姓在他逝世十周年时，自发修建的在宜生文博园品一品宜生酒香，逛一逛状元故居，去大声三场，听听百年魏停的钟声，再到张公，低上看潮起潮落，江水奔涌，海门的风里至今还藏着百年前那份敢为天下先的气魄，被南通段的长江给震撼了。漫天碧透，百舸争流，天下英雄如过江之机。站在海门，才算懂得何谓泱泱大国。四个字。一百年之后，张俭先生不止活在纪念馆里，他的家乡南通海门是万里长江奔流入海前，塑造了最后一块丰饶之地。南通人从这里出发，辞家千里又千里，务必争气，再争气。南通人建起的人民大会堂、国家博物馆、央视大楼、东方明珠、鸟巢、港珠澳大桥、世界最高楼、迪拜塔等等。中国现代化城市成就的幕后英雄就是无数南通人。你看到的不只是一个人的故乡，而是一个人的理想，怎样被写进这片土地，又怎样在一百年之后依然滋养着你我的生活。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00001",
      "start_ms": 540,
      "end_ms": 1180,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1360,
      "end_ms": 4220,
      "text": "他是全中国的父母都想移民去的一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4460,
      "end_ms": 7920,
      "text": "这里每十个高中生就有九个能够习提本科，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8280,
      "end_ms": 9960,
      "text": "这里就是真正的南哥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10320,
      "end_ms": 12480,
      "text": "南通中国近代第一城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12680,
      "end_ms": 13280,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13280,
      "end_ms": 16300,
      "text": "南通市中心最贵的一百平方留给了一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16780,
      "end_ms": 17140,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17140,
      "end_ms": 18820,
      "text": "他就没有今天的学通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19240,
      "end_ms": 21280,
      "text": "他去世的时候负债累累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21380,
      "end_ms": 23660,
      "text": "但他一生留下了三百七十所学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23980,
      "end_ms": 26000,
      "text": "他亲手打造了这个荒僻小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00013",
      "start_ms": 26060,
      "end_ms": 29420,
      "text": "百年之后竟然逆袭成GDP过万亿的工业强市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00014",
      "start_ms": 29660,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "他就是张俭先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00015",
      "start_ms": 31840,
      "end_ms": 32720,
      "text": "南通之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33400,
      "end_ms": 36620,
      "text": "八月二十四日是张俭先生逝世一百周年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36920,
      "end_ms": 37280,
      "text": "最近，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37280,
      "end_ms": 40800,
      "text": "央视热播的江海潮生讲述的正是他的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41240,
      "end_ms": 48460,
      "text": "张俭一生参与创建了南京大学、上海交通大学、同济大学、东南大学、复南大学等等几百座大学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48780,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "比如复旦大学建立时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50280,
      "end_ms": 52540,
      "text": "百分之六十的师资都来自南通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00022",
      "start_ms": 53040,
      "end_ms": 58940,
      "text": "他创办了中国第一所民办师范学校、通州师范与京师大学堂南洋公学、齐名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59300,
      "end_ms": 61470,
      "text": "像上海、南今、武汉等城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61470,
      "end_ms": 62995,
      "text": "输送了六千多名教师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63440,
      "end_ms": 71100,
      "text": "中国近代第一所纺织水利、工艺美术警察、新型戏剧艺术、女红、工人子弟玛雅等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71240,
      "end_ms": 75095,
      "text": "你能想象到大部分行业的第一所学校都诞生在南通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00027",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 78145,
      "text": "而中国人的一生也基本上摆不脱南通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00028",
      "start_ms": 78440,
      "end_ms": 79660,
      "text": "你上学做的试卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00029",
      "start_ms": 79680,
      "end_ms": 80445,
      "text": "南通出的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80650,
      "end_ms": 81695,
      "text": "你睡觉盖了被子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81890,
      "end_ms": 82675,
      "text": "南通产的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00032",
      "start_ms": 82880,
      "end_ms": 85275,
      "text": "你结婚买的房子还是南通人建的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85680,
      "end_ms": 89385,
      "text": "南通的高考一本率已经连续十年位居全国第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89880,
      "end_ms": 90720,
      "text": "张俭先生说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00035",
      "start_ms": 90820,
      "end_ms": 91480,
      "text": "父教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00036",
      "start_ms": 91480,
      "end_ms": 95330,
      "text": "而母实业实业向母亲负责创造财富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00037",
      "start_ms": 95430,
      "end_ms": 96235,
      "text": "养育社会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96500,
      "end_ms": 97100,
      "text": "而教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00039",
      "start_ms": 97100,
      "end_ms": 98920,
      "text": "像父亲负责培养人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99080,
      "end_ms": 99975,
      "text": "塑造未来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100420,
      "end_ms": 103100,
      "text": "一八五三年张俭出生在江苏海门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00042",
      "start_ms": 103240,
      "end_ms": 104035,
      "text": "一个农户家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00043",
      "start_ms": 104380,
      "end_ms": 105600,
      "text": "五岁就能被签字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00044",
      "start_ms": 105600,
      "end_ms": 105780,
      "text": "文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00045",
      "start_ms": 105780,
      "end_ms": 107115,
      "text": "十二岁出口成年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00046",
      "start_ms": 107420,
      "end_ms": 108265,
      "text": "可在那个年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00047",
      "start_ms": 108550,
      "end_ms": 110010,
      "text": "你能不能参加科举考试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00048",
      "start_ms": 110170,
      "end_ms": 111485,
      "text": "光靠你聪明还不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111790,
      "end_ms": 113835,
      "text": "竟然还要看祖上够不够资格。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00050",
      "start_ms": 114170,
      "end_ms": 116545,
      "text": "张戬只能借用别人的身份去应试，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00051",
      "start_ms": 116810,
      "end_ms": 117450,
      "text": "但没有想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00052",
      "start_ms": 117450,
      "end_ms": 118550,
      "text": "考中秀才之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00053",
      "start_ms": 118690,
      "end_ms": 121270,
      "text": "对方竟然借机敲诈张家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00054",
      "start_ms": 121270,
      "end_ms": 122550,
      "text": "因此倾家荡产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00055",
      "start_ms": 122590,
      "end_ms": 123785,
      "text": "欠下白银千两，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00056",
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 127195,
      "text": "但命运却没有给张姐一雪前耻的机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00057",
      "start_ms": 127480,
      "end_ms": 128400,
      "text": "二十六年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00058",
      "start_ms": 128400,
      "end_ms": 130280,
      "text": "他二十多次进出考场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00059",
      "start_ms": 130460,
      "end_ms": 132205,
      "text": "却最终没有考中进士。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00060",
      "start_ms": 132530,
      "end_ms": 133650,
      "text": "张戬心灰意冷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00061",
      "start_ms": 133650,
      "end_ms": 134745,
      "text": "几度想要放弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00062",
      "start_ms": 135080,
      "end_ms": 137440,
      "text": "终于在四十二岁一举夺魁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00063",
      "start_ms": 137580,
      "end_ms": 141050,
      "text": "考中状元、朱军状元啊状元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00064",
      "start_ms": 141050,
      "end_ms": 143025,
      "text": "这是天下文人的至高荣誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00065",
      "start_ms": 143220,
      "end_ms": 146225,
      "text": "也是多少人终其一生无可忘见的梦想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00066",
      "start_ms": 146740,
      "end_ms": 148520,
      "text": "但是张姐考中的那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00067",
      "start_ms": 148560,
      "end_ms": 150095,
      "text": "偏偏是甲午年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00068",
      "start_ms": 150470,
      "end_ms": 152295,
      "text": "北洋舰队全军覆没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00069",
      "start_ms": 152480,
      "end_ms": 154470,
      "text": "而朝廷却笙歌燕舞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00070",
      "start_ms": 154490,
      "end_ms": 155835,
      "text": "庆祝慈禧六十大寿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00071",
      "start_ms": 156280,
      "end_ms": 159405,
      "text": "当王公贵族都沉醉在天朝上国的幻想中时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00072",
      "start_ms": 159640,
      "end_ms": 163995,
      "text": "张戬这个刚入仕途的小翰林却站出来坚决主战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00073",
      "start_ms": 164640,
      "end_ms": 167235,
      "text": "甚至还上书弹劾大权在握的李鸿章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00074",
      "start_ms": 167810,
      "end_ms": 170230,
      "text": "张姐可不是那种普通的无用书生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00075",
      "start_ms": 170510,
      "end_ms": 173150,
      "text": "他曾经做过淮军名将吴长庆的幕僚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00076",
      "start_ms": 173290,
      "end_ms": 174955,
      "text": "协助平定了朝鲜叛乱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00077",
      "start_ms": 175320,
      "end_ms": 178955,
      "text": "他是水里进火里出战场上闯荡出来的硬汉子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00078",
      "start_ms": 179390,
      "end_ms": 180910,
      "text": "张戬中状元的第二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00079",
      "start_ms": 180950,
      "end_ms": 183205,
      "text": "马关条约签订割地赔管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00080",
      "start_ms": 183430,
      "end_ms": 184305,
      "text": "丧权辱国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00081",
      "start_ms": 184670,
      "end_ms": 186485,
      "text": "张戬在日记里字字泣血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00082",
      "start_ms": 186830,
      "end_ms": 187790,
      "text": "朝廷能忍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00083",
      "start_ms": 187870,
      "end_ms": 189725,
      "text": "无四万万同胞不能忍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00084",
      "start_ms": 189980,
      "end_ms": 191575,
      "text": "他做了一个违背祖宗的决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00085",
      "start_ms": 191840,
      "end_ms": 194460,
      "text": "他当着文武百官的面扔掉顶戴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00086",
      "start_ms": 194460,
      "end_ms": 196385,
      "text": "花梨弃官从商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00087",
      "start_ms": 197170,
      "end_ms": 198490,
      "text": "士农工商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00088",
      "start_ms": 198710,
      "end_ms": 200245,
      "text": "当时商的地位最低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00089",
      "start_ms": 200560,
      "end_ms": 202160,
      "text": "一个状元去经商。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00090",
      "start_ms": 202240,
      "end_ms": 204065,
      "text": "这在当时就是自甘堕落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00091",
      "start_ms": 204310,
      "end_ms": 205010,
      "text": "但张姐说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00092",
      "start_ms": 205350,
      "end_ms": 207550,
      "text": "愿成一分一毫有用之事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00093",
      "start_ms": 207550,
      "end_ms": 208570,
      "text": "不愿居八命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00094",
      "start_ms": 208570,
      "end_ms": 209925,
      "text": "九命可耻之官。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00095",
      "start_ms": 210690,
      "end_ms": 212070,
      "text": "为了筹集半场资金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00096",
      "start_ms": 212070,
      "end_ms": 216050,
      "text": "他放下状元身段、卖字、卖画、四处借债、求人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00097",
      "start_ms": 216050,
      "end_ms": 217650,
      "text": "甚至抵押了全部家产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00098",
      "start_ms": 217650,
      "end_ms": 218965,
      "text": "典当了妻子的手饰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00099",
      "start_ms": 219390,
      "end_ms": 220450,
      "text": "整整五年时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00100",
      "start_ms": 220450,
      "end_ms": 221985,
      "text": "沙场才艰难开工。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00101",
      "start_ms": 222250,
      "end_ms": 223670,
      "text": "为了栽种棉花彰碱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00102",
      "start_ms": 223670,
      "end_ms": 227315,
      "text": "组织筑堤挡潮、开渠排水、洗盐、改土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00103",
      "start_ms": 227560,
      "end_ms": 230905,
      "text": "把四千多万亩的盐碱地改造成棉田粮仓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00104",
      "start_ms": 231150,
      "end_ms": 233855,
      "text": "让苏北涌现出了上百家盐垦公司。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00105",
      "start_ms": 234230,
      "end_ms": 238485,
      "text": "今天的海门港一带仍然保留着见证这段历史的张公堤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00106",
      "start_ms": 238920,
      "end_ms": 239840,
      "text": "他疏浚河道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00107",
      "start_ms": 239960,
      "end_ms": 240785,
      "text": "修建船闸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00108",
      "start_ms": 241060,
      "end_ms": 244605,
      "text": "让海门青龙港成为长江北岸最繁忙的港口之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00109",
      "start_ms": 244880,
      "end_ms": 245980,
      "text": "在张姐的努力下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00110",
      "start_ms": 246060,
      "end_ms": 246840,
      "text": "大声沙场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00111",
      "start_ms": 246840,
      "end_ms": 248845,
      "text": "没几年就赚了四百万两白银，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00112",
      "start_ms": 249130,
      "end_ms": 251215,
      "text": "换做别人早就富甲一方了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00113",
      "start_ms": 251440,
      "end_ms": 254175,
      "text": "可是张姐一分钱都没有装进自己的口袋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00114",
      "start_ms": 254480,
      "end_ms": 256745,
      "text": "一件长衫能穿三四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00115",
      "start_ms": 257020,
      "end_ms": 257540,
      "text": "袜子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00116",
      "start_ms": 257560,
      "end_ms": 258945,
      "text": "棉袄破了就打补丁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00117",
      "start_ms": 259200,
      "end_ms": 261205,
      "text": "直到不能再破才换新的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00118",
      "start_ms": 261590,
      "end_ms": 263250,
      "text": "他对自己吝啬极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00119",
      "start_ms": 263350,
      "end_ms": 265710,
      "text": "却慷慨的设立育婴堂两年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00120",
      "start_ms": 265710,
      "end_ms": 267475,
      "text": "收养一千五百多个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00121",
      "start_ms": 267780,
      "end_ms": 268760,
      "text": "开办七流所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00122",
      "start_ms": 268780,
      "end_ms": 269640,
      "text": "收容乞丐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00123",
      "start_ms": 269640,
      "end_ms": 270845,
      "text": "教他们谋生技能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00124",
      "start_ms": 271160,
      "end_ms": 275035,
      "text": "也让南通成为当时全中国唯一街上没有乞丐的城市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00125",
      "start_ms": 275420,
      "end_ms": 276640,
      "text": "他建立计两所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00126",
      "start_ms": 276680,
      "end_ms": 279025,
      "text": "帮助风尘女子回归正常生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00127",
      "start_ms": 279360,
      "end_ms": 281520,
      "text": "自费组建测绘队、兴修水利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00128",
      "start_ms": 281520,
      "end_ms": 282180,
      "text": "建堤坝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00129",
      "start_ms": 282320,
      "end_ms": 283720,
      "text": "疏通河道三十多条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00130",
      "start_ms": 283920,
      "end_ms": 285735,
      "text": "修建桥梁四百多座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00131",
      "start_ms": 286070,
      "end_ms": 287770,
      "text": "还建了残疾院医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00132",
      "start_ms": 287930,
      "end_ms": 289070,
      "text": "让老有所依，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00133",
      "start_ms": 289110,
      "end_ms": 289890,
      "text": "幼有所长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00134",
      "start_ms": 290070,
      "end_ms": 291550,
      "text": "残疾者皆有所养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00135",
      "start_ms": 291730,
      "end_ms": 292745,
      "text": "六十大寿时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00136",
      "start_ms": 293010,
      "end_ms": 294675,
      "text": "亲友要为他大摆寿宴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00137",
      "start_ms": 294890,
      "end_ms": 298050,
      "text": "他就把寿宴的钱和贺礼全部拿去建了养老院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00138",
      "start_ms": 298250,
      "end_ms": 298675,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00139",
      "start_ms": 299020,
      "end_ms": 299820,
      "text": "一己之响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00140",
      "start_ms": 300000,
      "end_ms": 300400,
      "text": "何如，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00141",
      "start_ms": 300420,
      "end_ms": 301300,
      "text": "众人之安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00142",
      "start_ms": 301400,
      "end_ms": 302180,
      "text": "一日之废，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00143",
      "start_ms": 302360,
      "end_ms": 303715,
      "text": "何如百年之惠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00144",
      "start_ms": 304290,
      "end_ms": 306590,
      "text": "张戬先生在南通创办了大生纱场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00145",
      "start_ms": 306590,
      "end_ms": 310190,
      "text": "为全国各地输送了纺织机械三点二万多套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00146",
      "start_ms": 310350,
      "end_ms": 313350,
      "text": "推动了十几万家纺织企业遍地开花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00147",
      "start_ms": 313530,
      "end_ms": 315810,
      "text": "养活了全中国上千万人就业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00148",
      "start_ms": 316090,
      "end_ms": 316790,
      "text": "战乱年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00149",
      "start_ms": 316790,
      "end_ms": 319810,
      "text": "南通糖闸工业区奔赴祖国十八个省市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00150",
      "start_ms": 319930,
      "end_ms": 321790,
      "text": "为全国输送纺织业人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00151",
      "start_ms": 321810,
      "end_ms": 323050,
      "text": "二十一点七万人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00152",
      "start_ms": 323230,
      "end_ms": 324970,
      "text": "掏空了南通一半的家底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00153",
      "start_ms": 325270,
      "end_ms": 326170,
      "text": "但即便如此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00154",
      "start_ms": 326290,
      "end_ms": 328370,
      "text": "南通依然是世界家纺之都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00155",
      "start_ms": 328610,
      "end_ms": 331790,
      "text": "海门的叠石桥市场是全球最大的家纺市场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00156",
      "start_ms": 331930,
      "end_ms": 333310,
      "text": "承包了全国人的睡眠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00157",
      "start_ms": 333310,
      "end_ms": 336180,
      "text": "前世世界每十件家纺有六件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00158",
      "start_ms": 336180,
      "end_ms": 337800,
      "text": "都来自南通朱君。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00159",
      "start_ms": 338140,
      "end_ms": 340020,
      "text": "一个人究竟要留下些什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00160",
      "start_ms": 340200,
      "end_ms": 343600,
      "text": "才能够在离开一百年以后仍被人如此怀念。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00161",
      "start_ms": 343820,
      "end_ms": 348160,
      "text": "张俭先生在通海大地上布下了整座近代城市的格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00162",
      "start_ms": 348480,
      "end_ms": 350300,
      "text": "他创办了中国第一座博物院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00163",
      "start_ms": 350440,
      "end_ms": 351440,
      "text": "南通博物院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00164",
      "start_ms": 351580,
      "end_ms": 353360,
      "text": "比故宫博物院还早二十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00165",
      "start_ms": 353560,
      "end_ms": 354680,
      "text": "第一所气象台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00166",
      "start_ms": 355100,
      "end_ms": 357360,
      "text": "江苏第一条公路港闸公路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00167",
      "start_ms": 357400,
      "end_ms": 363080,
      "text": "而当时江苏省百分之七十的公路都在南通修建了苏北第一条铁路、青山铁路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00168",
      "start_ms": 363080,
      "end_ms": 366635,
      "text": "还成立了全国第一支交警、第一所交警学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00169",
      "start_ms": 366870,
      "end_ms": 369005,
      "text": "还建了南通第一个公共体育场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00170",
      "start_ms": 369310,
      "end_ms": 371775,
      "text": "让南通涌现了三十多位世界冠军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00171",
      "start_ms": 372140,
      "end_ms": 374665,
      "text": "他建公共图书馆、印书局、办报纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00172",
      "start_ms": 375070,
      "end_ms": 377250,
      "text": "让南通人用上了电灯电话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00173",
      "start_ms": 377630,
      "end_ms": 381585,
      "text": "张俭先生还以南通为核心服饰全国创办的七十家企业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00174",
      "start_ms": 381780,
      "end_ms": 384700,
      "text": "开创了无数个第一江浙渔业公司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00175",
      "start_ms": 384900,
      "end_ms": 387145,
      "text": "开创了我国拖网渔轮业的先河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00176",
      "start_ms": 387550,
      "end_ms": 391110,
      "text": "怡生酿造厂获得国酒类第一块世博会金牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00177",
      "start_ms": 391110,
      "end_ms": 392405,
      "text": "比茅台早了九年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00178",
      "start_ms": 392710,
      "end_ms": 397670,
      "text": "南通秀之局将分公司开到了纽约第五大道大达轮船公司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00179",
      "start_ms": 397670,
      "end_ms": 400365,
      "text": "修建了上海最著名的客运码头大达码头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00180",
      "start_ms": 400730,
      "end_ms": 404310,
      "text": "江西瓷业公司建设了中国第一家近代瓷器工厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00181",
      "start_ms": 404490,
      "end_ms": 406390,
      "text": "而张瑾还是申报了大股东。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00182",
      "start_ms": 406570,
      "end_ms": 408790,
      "text": "甚至你现在能去故宫参观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00183",
      "start_ms": 408830,
      "end_ms": 409665,
      "text": "也得感谢他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00184",
      "start_ms": 409980,
      "end_ms": 411725,
      "text": "就是在他的大礼倡议之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00185",
      "start_ms": 411970,
      "end_ms": 413470,
      "text": "才成立了古物陈列所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00186",
      "start_ms": 413550,
      "end_ms": 415645,
      "text": "让故宫走出了开放的第一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00187",
      "start_ms": 415990,
      "end_ms": 420705,
      "text": "他还牵头制定了中国第一部公司法商法总则森林法狩猎法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00188",
      "start_ms": 421200,
      "end_ms": 423220,
      "text": "张姐做事从不问难不难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00189",
      "start_ms": 423280,
      "end_ms": 424485,
      "text": "只问该不该。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00190",
      "start_ms": 424780,
      "end_ms": 425145,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00191",
      "start_ms": 425520,
      "end_ms": 427985,
      "text": "办一线事要有一省之眼光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00192",
      "start_ms": 428290,
      "end_ms": 429110,
      "text": "办一省事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00193",
      "start_ms": 429250,
      "end_ms": 430470,
      "text": "要有一国之眼光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00194",
      "start_ms": 430670,
      "end_ms": 431530,
      "text": "办一国事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00195",
      "start_ms": 431670,
      "end_ms": 433065,
      "text": "要有世界之眼光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00196",
      "start_ms": 433750,
      "end_ms": 434750,
      "text": "因为内忧外患，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00197",
      "start_ms": 434890,
      "end_ms": 436985,
      "text": "张戬的产业最终没能撑下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00198",
      "start_ms": 437330,
      "end_ms": 439150,
      "text": "一九二六年八月二十四日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00199",
      "start_ms": 439150,
      "end_ms": 441595,
      "text": "七十三岁的张俭先生抱汗而亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00200",
      "start_ms": 441990,
      "end_ms": 443895,
      "text": "十几万人在街边为他送行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00201",
      "start_ms": 444320,
      "end_ms": 444800,
      "text": "临死前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00202",
      "start_ms": 444800,
      "end_ms": 445770,
      "text": "他担心的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00203",
      "start_ms": 445770,
      "end_ms": 448890,
      "text": "这儿的电厂没能建成那儿的民兵制度没能普及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00204",
      "start_ms": 448950,
      "end_ms": 451025,
      "text": "从头到尾没有一件私事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00205",
      "start_ms": 451440,
      "end_ms": 453865,
      "text": "他的墓碑上简简单单的一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00206",
      "start_ms": 454250,
      "end_ms": 458220,
      "text": "南通张先生状元是皇帝给的先生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00207",
      "start_ms": 458360,
      "end_ms": 460250,
      "text": "是百姓教的先生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00208",
      "start_ms": 460250,
      "end_ms": 461250,
      "text": "这两个字很轻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00209",
      "start_ms": 461610,
      "end_ms": 462970,
      "text": "却装得下一座城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00210",
      "start_ms": 463270,
      "end_ms": 463990,
      "text": "胡适评价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00211",
      "start_ms": 463990,
      "end_ms": 464415,
      "text": "张姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00212",
      "start_ms": 464630,
      "end_ms": 466615,
      "text": "一个伟大的失败的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00213",
      "start_ms": 467400,
      "end_ms": 471250,
      "text": "可是朱军啊、朱军如果一家企业最终债台高筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00214",
      "start_ms": 471450,
      "end_ms": 474805,
      "text": "但他留下了工厂、学校、养老院、博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00215",
      "start_ms": 475060,
      "end_ms": 476660,
      "text": "让无数家庭有了生计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00216",
      "start_ms": 476660,
      "end_ms": 478040,
      "text": "让无数孩子改变了命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00217",
      "start_ms": 478040,
      "end_ms": 480845,
      "text": "密这个人究竟算成功还是失败？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00218",
      "start_ms": 481360,
      "end_ms": 482800,
      "text": "如果你来到南通海门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00219",
      "start_ms": 482920,
      "end_ms": 484215,
      "text": "不妨去张公祠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00220",
      "start_ms": 484500,
      "end_ms": 486960,
      "text": "这是家乡百姓在他逝世十周年时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00221",
      "start_ms": 487000,
      "end_ms": 490940,
      "text": "自发修建的在宜生文博园品一品宜生酒香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00222",
      "start_ms": 491020,
      "end_ms": 492445,
      "text": "逛一逛状元故居，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00223",
      "start_ms": 492760,
      "end_ms": 493800,
      "text": "去大声三场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00224",
      "start_ms": 494020,
      "end_ms": 495885,
      "text": "听听百年魏停的钟声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00225",
      "start_ms": 496570,
      "end_ms": 497270,
      "text": "再到张公，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00226",
      "start_ms": 497270,
      "end_ms": 499220,
      "text": "低上看潮起潮落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00227",
      "start_ms": 499380,
      "end_ms": 500285,
      "text": "江水奔涌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00228",
      "start_ms": 501050,
      "end_ms": 505655,
      "text": "海门的风里至今还藏着百年前那份敢为天下先的气魄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00229",
      "start_ms": 506230,
      "end_ms": 508425,
      "text": "被南通段的长江给震撼了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00230",
      "start_ms": 508790,
      "end_ms": 509950,
      "text": "漫天碧透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00231",
      "start_ms": 509990,
      "end_ms": 510890,
      "text": "百舸争流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00232",
      "start_ms": 510950,
      "end_ms": 512885,
      "text": "天下英雄如过江之机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00233",
      "start_ms": 513170,
      "end_ms": 513970,
      "text": "站在海门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00234",
      "start_ms": 513970,
      "end_ms": 516250,
      "text": "才算懂得何谓泱泱大国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00235",
      "start_ms": 516250,
      "end_ms": 516745,
      "text": "四个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00236",
      "start_ms": 517280,
      "end_ms": 518120,
      "text": "一百年之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00237",
      "start_ms": 518260,
      "end_ms": 520275,
      "text": "张俭先生不止活在纪念馆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00238",
      "start_ms": 520540,
      "end_ms": 524140,
      "text": "他的家乡南通海门是万里长江奔流入海前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00239",
      "start_ms": 524140,
      "end_ms": 525985,
      "text": "塑造了最后一块丰饶之地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00240",
      "start_ms": 526360,
      "end_ms": 527745,
      "text": "南通人从这里出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00241",
      "start_ms": 528100,
      "end_ms": 529640,
      "text": "辞家千里又千里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00242",
      "start_ms": 529700,
      "end_ms": 530700,
      "text": "务必争气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00243",
      "start_ms": 530780,
      "end_ms": 531515,
      "text": "再争气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00244",
      "start_ms": 531890,
      "end_ms": 539905,
      "text": "南通人建起的人民大会堂、国家博物馆、央视大楼、东方明珠、鸟巢、港珠澳大桥、世界最高楼、迪拜塔等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00245",
      "start_ms": 540370,
      "end_ms": 544395,
      "text": "中国现代化城市成就的幕后英雄就是无数南通人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00246",
      "start_ms": 544940,
      "end_ms": 546840,
      "text": "你看到的不只是一个人的故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00247",
      "start_ms": 547060,
      "end_ms": 548200,
      "text": "而是一个人的理想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00248",
      "start_ms": 548460,
      "end_ms": 550455,
      "text": "怎样被写进这片土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_71f506d9b21d8c43_s00249",
      "start_ms": 550740,
      "end_ms": 554355,
      "text": "又怎样在一百年之后依然滋养着你我的生活。"
    }
  ],
